eir trip!",9,""],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_130","Pfft-hahaha! Look at Teresa's face! Wait, how is Freesia still keeping a straight face...? They're nothing like me. It's hilarious.",9,""],["w",0.5],["choice",["You're all so different, yet you make such an incredible team."],[[]]],["w",0.1],["stg",0,0.0,-300.0,1.6,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_130","Hehe, thanks!",9,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,-280.0,1.5,"Linear",10.0,null,null,null],["say","avg1_130","When Post Haste first opened, we had the passion, but absolutely zero clue about how to actually run things.",9,""],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_130","We didn't have the funds to handle deliveries out in the remote regions.",9,""],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_130","So we took every commission we could get, micromanaged our routes, and scraped together travel fare before setting out.",9,""],["w",1.0],["se","se_056"],["say","avg1_130","But through it all, no matter how hard it got, I only had to look up to find Freesia and Teresa by my side.",9,""],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_130","That's how I know we'll find a way through anything, as long as we're together.",9,""],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_130","It's what they taught me.==W== No... It's a precious gift they gave me.",9,""],["w",1.0],["goon"],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_130","I haven't been on my own for a long time.",9,""],["w",1.0],["choice",["You really treasure them, don't you, Donna?"],[[]]],["w",1.0],["se","se_047"],["say","avg1_130","You bet! They're the most important partners I have!",9,""],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_130","Once they get down here, let's have fun together...",9,""],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,"Xiao"],["se","se_070"],["say","avg1_130","Huh?! W-wait?! The balloons...!==W== Seriously?! They're actually carrying me away?!!",9,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","posthouse_inside_dusk",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,50.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null]